title: "Clawpack V2 - Constitutional Multi-Agent AI Ecosystem with Shared Memory and A2A Routing"
version: 3.1.0
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.19713157
date-released: 2026-05-29
url: "https://github.com/greg-gzillion/clawpack_v2"
abstract: "21 specialized AI agents governed by a Constitution, communicating via A2A protocol (port 8766) with circuit breaker protection and task state tracking. Features 448MB Chronicle SQLite FTS5 index (35,000+ interactions), 3,800-city jurisdiction database, 36-system constitutional boundary, multi-provider LLM routing through Ollama, Groq, OpenRouter, and Anthropic, and cross-agent unified memory with staleness detection."
